  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tanzania Public Finance Management Reform Programme (PFMRP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to PFMRP Phase IV and V through the national basket fund modality, mainly to the Zanzibar component. The goal is to promote economic development and improved public service delivery. Domestic revenue mobilisation (DRM) to finance development (SDG 17.1) is partly integrated in PFMRP. Zanzibar Revenue Board (ZRB) is a significant beneficiary of the Norwegian support.</narrative>
  </description>
